WEBVTT

00:01:59.839 --> 00:02:02.344
unaleta kiburi kwa washindi

00:02:03.538 --> 00:02:07.208
na kufedhehesha waliopeteza.

00:02:08.050 --> 00:02:13.643
huchochea washindi 
kujiona bora zaidi

00:02:13.667 --> 00:02:18.542
na kusahau nasibu na uenyemali
iliyowasaidia kupata mafanikio.

00:02:19.002 --> 00:02:23.383
Na kupelekea kuonea 
wasiobahatika,

00:02:23.407 --> 00:02:26.176
na wasio na wasifi kama wao.

00:02:27.085 --> 00:02:29.569
Huu hujalisha kisiasa.